<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib, chuck and round cuts mostly firm, while loin cuts higher.  Beef trimmings steady to weak on light to moderate demand and offerings.-USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>256 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 52 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>43 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =	97.61	 97.38	 94.40	 94.05</p>
<p>Change	    0.71	  0.87	  0.75	  0.81</p>
<p>Rib	  149.76	148.44	139.93	139.90</p>
<p>Chuck	 70.47	 68.86	 71.25	 69.35</p>
<p>Round	 89.24	 89.24	 89.12	 89.12</p>
